-- A window function inside PARTITION BY or ORDER BY of an inline window is not rejected during analysis
-- The largest 32-bit offset, 2147483647, is rejected although the message asks for a 32-bit integer; 2147483646 is accepted
[3,3,3]
-- IGNORE NULLS is silently accepted on functions that do not pick a value, while RESPECT NULLS is rejected for them
0	1	1	1	0	1	0	1
1	2	2	2	0	2	0	1
2	3	3	3	1	0	0	2
